SUMMARY:Illumination at Prima Theatre
DESCRIPTION:Step into the glow\, where candlelight\, harmony\, and the beauty of the holiday season surround you. \nThis intimate experience returns newly imagined — beloved songs reborn in-the-round by radiant performers and rich live music. Every seat is wrapped in warmth and wonder\, offering moments of peace and a welcome rise of joy in the midst of the season’s rush. \nImmerse yourself in this soul-stirring concert that reminds us of what still feels sacred and leaves you carrying a little more light with you. \nGet Tickets \n \nCome Explore Our Lancaster Theaters and the Arts\n\n\nLive Theater\nLive Entertainment\nLive Music\n\n\n\nDinner Theaters\nMurder Mysteries\nThings To Do\n\n\n\nArtisan Collectives\nArt Galleries\nEvents Calendar
