SUMMARY:Santa’s Paradise Express at Strasburg Rail Road
DESCRIPTION:All board Santa’s Paradise Express!\nThis Christmas season\, ignite a new tradition or celebrate an old one with your family as you ride the rails at Strasburg Rail Road. Our daily Christmas trains include all the festivities that make the holidays special: Carolers and brass players bring you your all-time favorite carols\, Santa’s helpers will gift your child a special gift from the North Pole\, and your train ride even includes a visit from the big man himself\, Santa Claus!\nThis 45-minute train ride through the beautiful Amish countryside is certain to bring your family closer together and make your holiday season extra special!\nWhat to expect before arrival:\n\nYou can check in at our station box office between platforms 3 & 4.\nBe sure to arrive at least 30 minutes early\, as the train will begin boarding 15 minutes before departure.\nArrive even earlier to check out our live Christmas revue shows on the Town Square Stage at the heart of the station.\nAll you need to bring with you is a big helping of holiday cheer\, and even if you don’t\, we’ll ensure you leave with some!\n\nGet your tickets now\, we hope to see you here!
URL:https://lancasterpa.com/events-calendar/santas-paradise-express-at-strasburg-rail-road/2026-11-21/
LOCATION:Strasburg Rail Road\, 301 Gap Road\, Ronks\, PA\, 17572\, United States
