SUMMARY:Amish Christmas Cookie Tour in Lancaster
DESCRIPTION:Interact with Amish families in their homes and learn about their heritage while sampling homemade cookies. This holiday season\, make new friends\, learn new recipes\, and create memories to last a lifetime. \nTake a step away from the stress of the holidays\, slow down\, and let us take you on a relaxing and festive journey. We will visit three authentic Amish homes to sample homemade Christmas cookies. You’ll leave with an appreciation of another culture\, along with recipes and cookies to take home and enjoy. \nDad doesn’t need another tie\, and Mom doesn’t want another gift card. Spend time with your loved ones this holiday season; join us for our Christmas cookie tour! \nIMPORTANT: Please indicate at the time of booking if you are traveling with another party\, so that we can do our best to ensure you travel together. Our buses hold a maximum of 14 passengers. Toddlers are required to have their own seat and cannot be held in a lap. \nDue to the special nature of this tour\, this tour is not handicap accessible\, and we are unfortunately unable to accommodate any special dietary requests. \nPlease note – toddler pricing does not include cookies.
URL:https://lancasterpa.com/events-calendar/amish-christmas-cookie-tour-in-lancaster/2026-11-21/
LOCATION:Amish Farm and House\, 2395 Covered Bridge Drive\, Lancaster\, PA\, 17602\, United States
CATEGORIES:Autumn,Children & Family Events,Christmas Events in Lancaster County,Christmas Tour
