SUMMARY:Night Before Christmas at Strasburg Rail Road
DESCRIPTION:Join us at Strasburg Rail Road for a cozy evening tradition that has been around for almost 15 years and is certain to become a yearly ritual for your family as well! \nOur Night Before Christmas trains will put you in the holiday spirit as our talented cast recites the classic poem by Clement Clarke Moore as well as other festive Christmas stories. Your family will also be regaled by a troupe of carolers singing and dancing to a medley of your favorite Christmas carols. But the night would not be complete without the timeless combination of milk and cookies and perhaps even a glimpse of Santa Claus himself hurriedly preparing for his most important night of the year! You definitely don’t want to miss out on experiencing this special holiday train ride\, so book your tickets now! \nWhat to expect upon arrival: Be sure to arrive at least 30 minutes early\, as the train will begin boarding 15 minutes before departure. You can check in at our station box office between platforms 3 & 4. All aboard!
