SUMMARY:Thanksgiving Day Tour with Strasburg Scooter Tours
DESCRIPTION:What better way to relax before “Crazy Uncle Harvey” arrives and the feasting begins on Thanksgiving Day. Enjoy a ride on a 50cc scooter to visit 19th-century covered bridges with an experienced guide. \nThis tour offers exceptional views of the countryside\, including Amish farms and schoolhouses\, as well as an insightful look at one of Lancaster County’s oldest covered bridges. This tour will give you a uniquely exciting way to get back in touch with historic Pennsylvania. \nItinerary\nDuration: 2-3 hours Some of our past tours have included: \n\nA guided tour of two of Lancaster County’s most beautiful covered bridges\nA ride through Lancaster’s backcountry road during the loveliest time of year.\n\nEach year is unique\, so you never know what we might have in store for you!
